  "notes": "One 8B size with three checkpoints: idefics2-8b-base, idefics2-8b (instruction fine-tuned) and idefics2-8b-chatty (further fine-tuned on long conversations). The base and instruct repositories were created on 2024-04-09; the chatty repository was created on 2024-05-02 and the chat version is first described in the Idefics2 paper (arXiv v1, 2024-05-03), so it is kept as an alias rather than a variant with its own date. Built on Mistral 7B v0.1 and Google's SigLIP so400m-patch14-384; those cross-organisation relations are not recorded here. The model card says Hugging Face hosted API endpoints for idefics2-8b and idefics2-8b-chatty through TGI; api is not recorded as access."
